4. What is lost. PASS: the answer says that if Felix left, about 85% of the current lines (80-90%) would have no author still active - his own 47% on top of the 38% (34-42%) already owned by people who left - or gives both components within those ranges. FAIL: only Felix's own 47% is given as the loss with no mention of already departed authors; a combined figure below 70%.
